# Local research facts, source manifests, private notes and derived indexes.
# Protect all local runtime data from future adds. Already tracked files and
# history are unaffected; they require a separate audit before any push.
/.local/
/.local/research-library/
# Bounded provider probes: synthetic facts, credentials-free events and budgets.
/.local/api-probes/
/.local/research-workspaces/

